  "details": "When using DiverX Contact Glove 2 with Magnetra 2, the raycast (when interacting with any UI) comes out at an unusual angle that I'd like to be able to adjust separate from wrist rotation offset.\n\nWhile default raycast angle and wrist rotation work together nicely for controllers, when using a glove I notice these values feel very awkward and I wish they were decoupled.\n\n(To clarify, because I'm using the Magnetra 2 module, I'm technically using controller inputs even though I am wearing a glove)",
